  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Pandy Fackler** (1 review): Listener had this song stuck in their head all day and found its lick by listening through the show [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2000-07-01** (recommended): source not stated; 32 songs; 156 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Deaner's tour diary says he enjoyed the show but wanted a scummier venue, and called the stage monitors the best he'd heard [1]\n- After the gig, Deaner lost $400 at blackjack, then won it back plus $200 around 4 am, and later saw Hoover Dam [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2000-07-01**: taped by JKeats; transferred by JKeats; source: MBHO 603 > Sound Devices MP2 Preamp > Graham Patten ADC > Sony D8 [1]",
